  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marawi Recovery Project: Support for Enhancing Agri-based Livelihoods of Internally Displaced Farmers Affected by the Marawi Conflict</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intermediate objectives of the project are:

3.1 IDPs demonstrate sustainable benefits from livelihood training and assistance.
3.2 Livelihood projects are earning, sustainable, environmentally friendly, and do no harm.
3.3 IDPs and the communities in which they are hosted or to which they return or resettle, are peacefully working together to improve the quality of life for all.</narrative>
  </description>
